    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in a magical 2D world with thousands of online players in this MMORPG!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Factions<br />\r\nChoose a side in this great story! Fight with the Draxian nobles or the ferocious Naru.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* PvP<br />\r\nFight other players in this open world or compete in the world ranking to get fabulous prizes or rewards!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Exploration<br />\r\nExplore a huge open world full of magic and adventures to reveal. Meet new friends on your own adventure!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Professiones<br />\r\nChoose between 3 professions: mining, elementalism and jewelry.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Enchantment<br />\r\nUpgrade your items by enchanting them to make them unique.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Commerce<br />\r\nMake exchanges with other players to get items, materials, minerals and even pets!<br />\r\nSearch for that item that you love it in the Auction House!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Emotes<br />\r\nReact with emotes to have fun with other friends in game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHistory:<br />\r\nRecent military encounters have unleashed a new war between the Draxian and the Naru.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJoin the noble draxian warriors, those who fight for justice and order.<br />\r\nOr fight alongside the ancestral Naru tribe, defending nature and balance in the universe.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate new friends and play with thousands of people online!",
    "about_the_game": "Immerse yourself in a magical 2D world with thousands of online players in this MMORPG!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Factions<br />\r\nChoose a side in this great story! Fight with the Draxian nobles or the ferocious Naru.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* PvP<br />\r\nFight other players in this open world or compete in the world ranking to get fabulous prizes or rewards!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Exploration<br />\r\nExplore a huge open world full of magic and adventures to reveal. Meet new friends on your own adventure!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Professiones<br />\r\nChoose between 3 professions: mining, elementalism and jewelry.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Enchantment<br />\r\nUpgrade your items by enchanting them to make them unique.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Commerce<br />\r\nMake exchanges with other players to get items, materials, minerals and even pets!<br />\r\nSearch for that item that you love it in the Auction House!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Emotes<br />\r\nReact with emotes to have fun with other friends in game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHistory:<br />\r\nRecent military encounters have unleashed a new war between the Draxian and the Naru.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJoin the noble draxian warriors, those who fight for justice and order.<br />\r\nOr fight alongside the ancestral Naru tribe, defending nature and balance in the universe.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate new friends and play with thousands of people online!",
    "short_description": "Enter a magical 2D world online with thousands of players in this MMORPG! Make new friends and play with thousands online! The adventure is yours.",
